@page "/"

<MudPaper Elevation="2" Class="pa-6">
    <MudText Align="Align.Center" Typo="Typo.h4" Class="mb-1">Eragon Visualizer</MudText>
    <MudText Align="Align.Center" Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mb-6">
        An interactive character tracker for the Eragon Universe. All content credit goes to Christopher Paolini. Tool created by cantseasharp.
    </MudText>
    <MudText Align="Align.Center" Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mb-6">
        This tool is still a work in progress. Not all content has been added, and there may be bugs.
    </MudText>

    <MudDivider Class="mb-6" />

    <MudGrid>

        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">📖 What is this?</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
                If you've ever lost track of where Eragon, Saphira, or any other character is during the story —
                this tool is for you. As you read through the Inheritance Cycle, you can follow along on an
                interactive map of Alagaësia and see exactly where each character is at any point in the books.
            </MudText>

            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">🗺️ How does the map work?</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
                The map is zoomable and pannable — scroll to zoom in, drag to move around.
                Each character is shown with a colored pin at their current location.
                As you progress through the story, you'll also see a faded trail showing where
                they've been over the last few chapters, with lines connecting the dots.
            </MudText>
        </MudItem>

        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">🔒 Spoiler-safe Visuals</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
                The most important feature: you only ever see what you've already read.
                Use the chapter slider at the top of each book's page to choose what chapter you are currently reading,
                and the map will only show character positions up to the start of that chapter.
                No accidental spoilers about where someone ends up later in the story.
            </MudText>

            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">⭐ Named locations</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
                Important cities, landmarks, and locations are marked with gold stars on the map.
                When a character is at a named location, they'll show up under that star rather than
                as a separate pin. Click any star or pin to see exactly who is there.
            </MudText>
        </MudItem>

        <MudItem xs="12">
            <MudDivider Class="mb-4" />
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">🚀 Getting started</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
                Pick a book from the menu on the left. Use the chapter slider to move through the story.
                Use the playback controls to animate the characters' journeys automatically.
                Click any marker on the map to see more details about that character or location.
            </MudText>
        </MudItem>

    </MudGrid>
</MudPaper>
